<title>USA: Meris Laboratories bank debt purchased.</title>
<headline>Meris Laboratories bank debt purchased.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meris Laboratories Inc said its obligations to Silicon Valley Bancshares have been purchased by Cerberus Partners LP.</p>
<p>These obligations have matured, and Meris is in default of a number of covenants under the governing documents.</p>
<p>A forbearance agreement previously entered to with Silicon Valley expired on September 15, 1996.</p>
<p>Meris said the purchase was the result of continuing discussions with Cerberus Partners with respect to the implementation of its strategic plan.</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
